---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<section class="pt-14 pb-16 sm:pt-16 sm:pb-20 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-24 border-b border-monolith-line dark:border-monolith-darkLine">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 max-w-6xl">
    <p class="eyebrow">{site.role}</p>
    <h1 class="text-[2.5rem] sm:text-6xl font-medium [text-wrap:balance] leading-[1.06] tracking-tightest">
      I deliver enterprise systems across APAC,<br class="hidden xl:block" /> and build and run software of my own.
    </h1>
    <div class="max-w-2xl pt-2 space-y-4 text-base sm:text-lg muted leading-relaxed">
      <p>I manage business platforms across Asia-Pacific markets, from e-commerce and CMS to CRM and service desk. I translate what the business needs into what vendor teams build, keep delivery and budgets on track, and make sure every release is tested before go-live. When something gets stuck, I'm hands-on enough to fix it myself.</p>
      <p>I've also been building software of my own for years, including web apps, browser extensions and Windows tools downloaded hundreds of thousands of times. I do the whole job, from design and code to tests, deployment and keeping it running.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
